---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Shangri-La Yunnan Travel Guide"
  description="Privacy policy for Shangri-La Yunnan Travel Guide. No cookies, no analytics, no personal data collected. A static site with no user accounts."
>
  <main class="pt-16">
    <div class="bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-100">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-emerald-600">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500">Last updated: August 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
      <section class="space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Our Approach to Privacy</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Shangri-La Guide is a static information website. We take a minimal approach to data collection.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mt-10">Information We Do Not Collect</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
          <li>We do not use cookies, tracking scripts, or analytics.</li>
          <li>We do not collect personal information such as names, email addresses, or IP addresses.</li>
          <li>We do not run advertisements or ad-tracking networks.</li>
          <li>We do not have user accounts, comment sections, or any mechanism to submit personal data.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mt-10">Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Our website loads fonts from Google Fonts and map tiles from CARTO for the interactive map on our homepage. These services may collect standard server log data as part of their normal operation. Please refer to their respective privacy policies for details.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mt-10">Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">If you have any questions about this privacy policy, please email us at <a href="mailto:hello@shangri-la-yunnan.com" class="text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700 underline">hello@shangri-la-yunnan.com</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3">
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">&copy; 2024&ndash;2026 Shangri-La Guide.</p>
      <a href="/" class="text-sm text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors font-medium">Back to Home</a>
    </div>
  </footer>
</BaseLayout>